# lib/ (vendored dependency jars) is excluded, EXCEPT openlcb.jar --
# pom.xml declares it with <scope>system</scope> pointing directly at
# this exact path ("not yet available on a maven repository"), so
# without it every Maven build (even a bare `mvn compile`) fails
# immediately at dependency resolution, before running any goal --
# unlike other lib/ jars, there's no lazy-load workaround possible.
/lib/*
!/lib/openlcb.jar
